            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लेखापालाने संध्याकाळी काम आटोपलं आणि तो घरी गेला. lekhāpālāne sandhyākāḷī kām āṭoplaṁ āṇi to gharī gelā. The accountant wrapped up his work in the evening and went home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने काम आटोपलं, tyāne kām āṭoplaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Close to उरकणे: both say a job was finished."
